{c: Verse 1}
[Em] [C] [D] [G],        Tu tu hai wohi dil ne jise apna kaha
[Em] [D],        Tu hai jahaan main hoon vahaan
[B7] [E],        Ab to ye jeena tere bin hai saza
[Am],        Ho mil jaaye is tarah
[G],        Do leharen jis tarah
[Em] [D],        Phir ho na juda
[D] [Em],        Haan ye vaada raha
[Em] [D] [Em],        Main aawaz hun to tu hai geet mera
[Em] [D] [Em],        Jahaan se niraala manmeet mera
[Am],        Ho mil jaaye is tarah....
[Em] [D] [Em],        Kisi mod pe bhi na ye saath chute
[Em] [D] [Em],        Mere haath se tera daaman na chhute
[Em] [D] [Em],        Kabhi khwab mai bhi tu muzse na ruthe
[Em] [D] [Em],        Mere pyaar ki koi khushiyaan na loote
[Em] [D] [Em],        Kabhi zindagi mein pade mushkilein to
[Em] [D] [Em],        Mujhe tu sambhale tuze mai sambhalun
[Em] [D] [Em],        Tuze main jaha ki nazar se chura loon
[Em] [D] [Em],        Kahi dil ke kone me tuzko bitha doon
